@startuml
title P3 Acceptance - Review, Independent Gating, Rollback, and Beta

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

participant "Acceptance foundation" as Foundation
participant "Coordinator DB" as DB
participant "Coordinator" as Coord
participant "Windows/macOS nodes" as Nodes
participant "Internal orbit" as Internal
participant "External reviewer" as Reviewer
participant "Real beta homes" as BetaHomes
participant "Operators" as Ops

Foundation -> Ops : Freeze C1-C7 matrix,\nflag permutations, review packet,\nartifact rules
Foundation -> DB : Freeze migration and rollback fixtures

Ops -> DB : Apply additive phase-three migration set
Ops -> Coord : Deploy coordinator with\nphase-three handlers inert by default
Coord -> Coord : Read unknown rows without\nclaiming phase-three ready

Ops -> Nodes : Roll out reviewed builds
Nodes --> Coord : register phase-three capabilities\nand redaction-safe telemetry

Ops -> Internal : Enable live_ptt only
Coord -> Nodes : live PTT flow under live_ptt
Internal --> Ops : C1-C3 matrix + rollback signatures

Ops -> Internal : Enable e2ee_media only after\nstory proof and review packet are ready
Coord -> Nodes : E2EE media under separate gate
Internal --> Ops : C4-C6 matrix + disclosure deltas

Ops -> Internal : Enable automation surface
Internal --> Ops : C7 safety evidence + revoke drills

Ops -> Reviewer : Deliver threat model,\nartifacts, builds, seeded accounts
Reviewer --> Ops : Findings by severity
Ops -> Coord : Fix and retest critical/high findings
Reviewer --> Ops : Closure confirmation

Ops -> Coord : Rehearse rollback and recovery
Coord -> DB : preserve phase-three rows
Ops -> Coord : Disable e2ee_media or live_ptt independently
Coord --> Ops : unsupported paths degrade honestly
Ops -> Coord : Revoke keys/tokens, recover slots,\nprove capture-stop drills

Ops -> BetaHomes : Start dated 7-day beta
BetaHomes --> Ops : daily incidents, jitter,\nlatency, capture, crypto, automation trends
Ops -> Ops : hold if stuck capture,\nrunaway automation, or key-loss occurs

Ops -> Coord : Review packet and claims
Ops -> Ops : publish promotion packet\nor exact remaining blockers

@enduml
